docs/ops/critic-*.log*
# Per-operator overrides + multi-repo dir + worker-planted settings
forge-loop.local.yaml
.forge/*
# ...except the durable cognition, which IS committed (single-maintainer .forge,
# dogfood #135): the seed manifestos + the frontier cursor (the maestro's
# direction). The runtime stores stay ignored: events.db (append-only journal,
# rotates at 10MB) and tasks.db (transient in-flight sagas) are local state.
!.forge/product-vision.md
!.forge/axes.yaml
!.forge/quality-manifesto.md
!.forge/testing-manifesto.md
!.forge/frontier.yaml
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
